# FCC record byte-preservation policy — frozen architecture v0.1.2 §2
# Cryptographic/evidentiary artifacts are protected from Git working-tree
# transformations (line-ending conversion, encoding changes). No other
# preservation scheme is used; this is normative.
record/** -text
governance/frozen/** -text
governance/keys/** -text
*.ots binary
*.ndjson -text
*.json -text
